  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien song blending country and R&B, produced at bedroom scale rather than studio scale. Clean electric guitar playing country-inflected double stops and slides, Rhodes electric piano holding warm seventh chords, drum kit played with brushes and recorded close, round electric bass, a single lap steel line in the bridge. Warm and close with a small intimate room sound and no large reverb. Male voice, soulful and relaxed with R&B phrasing, deliberately without traditional Taiwanese ballad ornamentation or weeping vibrato. 98 BPM, G major. A debt paid in the wrong direction. No orchestral strings, no synth, no opera percussion, no sobbing melisma, no key change.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n囡仔十四個月 攏猶未講話\n規家伙仔逐工咧教 教「爸爸」 教「媽媽」\n阮阿母無教 伊干焦共伊抱 共伊唱歌\n唱的是伊細漢時 阮阿嬤唱予伊聽的彼條\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n彼工下晡 無人咧注意\n囡仔忽然間出聲\n\n[Chorus]\n頭一聲 伊叫「阿嬤」\n毋是爸爸 毋是媽媽\n阮阿母彼下 攏無講話\n伊共囡仔攬牢牢 共面囥佇囡仔的頭毛內底\n\n[Verse]\n後來阮問伊 「你是按怎教的」\n伊講伊無教 伊干焦一直唱\n伊講「伊聽著的聲 上濟的是我」\n這句話 阮想甲今仔日\n\n[Chorus]\n頭一聲 伊叫「阿嬤」\n毋是爸爸 毋是媽媽\n阮阿母彼下 攏無講話\n伊共囡仔攬牢牢 攬甲阮袂記得伊捌遐爾歹\n\n[Outro]\n這馬囡仔會曉講真濟話矣\n伊上愛講的 猶原是彼兩字",
